OL,3,GNEWSAFive takeaways from Norwich City's
OL,4,Alatest accounts
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorwich City Football Club has released
OL,7,Fits latest annual report, detailing the
OL,8,Fclub's financial standing for the year
OL,9,Funtil 30 June 2026.
OL,11,FIt shows the Canaries recorded an
OL,12,Foperating loss of #13.3m - despite
OL,13,Fmaking almost #46m in profit from
OL,14,Fselling players.
OL,16,FBefore taking player trading into
OL,17,Faccount, the club recorded an operating
OL,18,Floss of #42.3m, compared with a #25.5m
OL,19,Floss in 2025.b@K
